    "description": "Join millions of other players around the globe to build your kingdom, raid your friends, and explore new worlds in PRIZE KINGDOMS!\r\n\r\nDISCOVER NEW WORLDS\r\nCome play a fantasy board game where you roll dice and travel to hundreds of gorgeous and interactive boards! In PRIZE KINGDOMS you\u2019ll build your boards, play exciting mini-games, collect rare and rewarding cards, and more! Each board you explore features its own mini games, secret areas, and hidden treasure to find!\r\n\r\nWHAT KIND OF FRIEND ARE YOU?\r\nBe a nice friend or a mean friend!  You can steal your friends\u2019 gold and destroy their bases!  Or you can be nice and team up in Clubs to compete together for the biggest prizes! \r\n\r\nPRIZE KINGDOMS is the only game that allows you to:\r\n- Combine rolling dice and building your kingdom, with hundreds of boards to conquer!\r\n- Join up with other players or create your own club and participate in leagues to earn huge prizes!\r\n- Explore dungeons with twisting paths, sky realms with crumbling tiles, take a rollercoaster ride, or hop on a rocket and blast off in dozens of exciting bonus rounds and minigames!\r\n- Open card packs, trade cards with friends and club mates, and complete your album to win HUGE rewards!\r\n\r\nDownload now and start rolling the dice in PRIZE KINGDOMS!\r\n\r\nNeed help? Tap the Support button in the settings menu in the Prize Kingdoms game, or send us a message at support@prizekingdoms.com.",
